WEBVTT

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:08.400
Tooru!

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:10.570
Want some ice cream?

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:11.780
Huh?

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:13.360
She's not here.

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:21.540
Run-chan...

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:26.290
What are you doing there?

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:27.790
I fell off in my sleep.

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:29.670
I can't move.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:30.630
Help me.

00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:34.880
Coochie-coochie-coo!

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:36.180
Sto- Stop it-

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:38.010
Coochie-coochie-coo!

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:42.520
What are you doing?

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:45.520
I just felt the urge to.

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:47.400
And one more!

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.150
Stop it...

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:51.440
Nice shot!

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:24.540
Here you go, Tooru.

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:27.160
Let's dig in!

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:32.000
Delicious!

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:39.550
Tooru, your bangs have gotten longer.

00:02:40.640 --> 00:02:44.600
It's because I've left them alone since summer vacation started.

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:46.220
I'll cut them for you!

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:47.020
Huh?

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:48.480
Scissors!

00:02:49.100 --> 00:02:50.850
With those scissors?

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:53.270
Yep. Stay still.

00:02:58.740 --> 00:02:59.700
Wait!

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:01.280
You're going to hold the scissors horizontally and cut?

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:03.530
Hm?

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:09.040
Um... you look rejuvenated!

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:11.540
A ransel backpack would look good on you!

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:13.630
Not even middle schoolers wear those...

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:16.880
I'm done for. I can't go to school like this.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.340
It's summer vacation right now.

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.930
There's the mid-vacation school day.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:24.100
Don't worry, it looks cute!

00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:25.180
That's the problem.

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:29.310
In that case...

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:33.940
Bring this up here, and...

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:36.940
There we go!

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:38.610
We match!

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:42.860
We match...

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.380
Coming!

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:02.680
Good morning.

00:04:03.050 --> 00:04:05.010
Good morning, Tooru-chan!

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:08.350
I'm sorry, I'm afraid Run's still asleep.

00:04:08.350 --> 00:04:10.270
Could you wake her up for me?

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.770
Certainly. I'm coming in, then.

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:15.940
Run-chan.

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:17.610
We have school today.

00:04:20.490 --> 00:04:22.030
Run-chan!

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.400
We're going to school!

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:32.330
You're wearing long sleeves again, even though it's summer.

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:34.870
I keep telling you,

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:38.710
you'd look cuter in lighter clothes.

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:39.710
Run-chan!

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:41.800
Go on.

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:43.380
Take it off...

00:04:44.050 --> 00:04:46.220
I'll take it off! I'll take it off!

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:51.720
So hot...

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:56.100
It's making my head all fuzzy...

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:59.190
Run-chan! School isn't that way.

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:03.320
It sure is creepy.

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:06.950
All the perverts and molesters come out during the summer, don't they?

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:10.370
I heard some of them call out at you from their cars.

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:13.330
It makes my spine tingle.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:15.500
We'd better be careful.

00:05:18.210 --> 00:05:21.340
Hey, want to get out of the heat and ride to school with me?

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:28.090
A molester!

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:33.600
Somebody! There's a pervert here!

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:35.980
No way...

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:38.020
A pervert?

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:40.110
Should we report him to the police?

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.400
This is a misunderstanding!

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:45.860
I'm a teacher at their school!

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:47.530
Please don't report me!

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:50.120
Okay then.

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:52.330
I'm handing out some forms, so pass them back.

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:56.910
Just fill out that survey by the start of next semester.

00:05:56.910 --> 00:05:58.500
Okay.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:00.880
Everyone, listen up!

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:04.630
This is a survey about your future plans.

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:07.880
Please think it over carefully before next semester.

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:09.890
Don't write something silly

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:11.850
just because you're still first-years.

00:06:12.260 --> 00:06:15.020
If you slack off, it'll be exam time before you know it.

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:17.600
Even during the rest of your vacation,

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:21.150
don't lose focus, and study hard.

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:25.530
Dismissed!

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:27.240
See you next semester!

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:37.910
Kitou-sensei.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:39.710
Tooru-san.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:43.630
Sensei, you look pale today. Are you okay?

00:06:44.050 --> 00:06:45.210
Oh my.

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:47.420
<i>What a kind girl.</i>

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:49.800
<i>She's my student, all right.</i>

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:50.840
You're right.

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:52.760
I've had a slight headache since this morning.

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.680
There's medicine in the nurse's office.

00:06:56.470 --> 00:06:58.890
I can beat this headache with enthusiasm!

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:01.270
Oh?

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:04.230
Dear me, what's this, Kitou-sensei?

00:07:04.230 --> 00:07:05.900
Wearing a white coat again, I see.

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:07.570
That's my territory you're invading.

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.950
It's none of your business!

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:13.740
Besides, I've been wearing this since before you came here!

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:14.870
Still,

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:18.120
when you think of a white coat, you think of the nurse, don't you?

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:20.410
Speak for yourself, Satou-sensei!

00:07:20.410 --> 00:07:23.210
Please do something about that ridiculous patterned shirt of yours!

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:24.340
Eh?

00:07:24.340 --> 00:07:26.960
Are you saying I have bad taste?

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:29.630
I don't think you're in a position to talk.

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:33.090
Well then, let's have Tooru-san decide!

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:34.260
Fine by me.

00:07:34.850 --> 00:07:36.220
Oh my. Tooru-san?

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:37.470
Uni-chan?

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:39.100
Tooru-san?

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:40.230
Kitou-sensei.

00:07:40.230 --> 00:07:41.850
Did you step on Uni-chan?

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.060
What?!

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:44.520
I'll bet it was you!

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:46.270
No, I'm sure it was you.

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:48.110
No, it was you!

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:49.400
No, I'm sure it was you.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:50.440
No...

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:55.490
<i>That's...</i>

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:58.290
<i>Could it be... an SOS signal?</i>

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:02.040
<i>The first-years' classroom?!</i>

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:03.080
<i>Just hang in there!</i>

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:07.880
This way you don't have to go downstairs

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:09.550
to shake off the chalk dust.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:13.590
How did the chalkboard rag get so dirty?

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:14.760
Right?

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:16.470
"Right?" isn't an answer.

00:08:18.100 --> 00:08:19.180
Where's the fire?

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:27.650
Um, senpai.

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:29.940
What's wrong?

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:32.360
<i>This atmosphere...</i>

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.530
<i>I must have jumped to the wrong conclusion.</i>

00:08:35.570 --> 00:08:37.120
Um, you see...

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:39.370
I'm...

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:42.000
I'm here to clean!

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:43.830
<i>I want to die.</i>

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:45.330
I'm so sorry, senpai.

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:48.130
If it weren't for her stupid ideas...

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:50.130
N-No, it's fine.

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:52.670
I mistake situations all the time.

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:56.300
I've got another funny story to tell now.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:58.100
Right, Tooru?

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:02.680
If only I'd stopped Yutaka earlier,

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:05.730
you wouldn't have embarrassed yourself like this, Yuuko.

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:07.810
I'm sorry.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:11.110
Stop it! Please, don't apologize!

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:14.400
It's even more embarrassing when you apologize to me!

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:16.410
I'm sorry.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:18.030
Stop it!

00:09:18.030 --> 00:09:19.870
Easily flustered, isn't she?

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:20.620
Watch it.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:24.080
It really looked like a distress signal.

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:27.670
When I saw it, all I could think of was "fire"!

00:09:27.670 --> 00:09:30.170
If it was a fire, there would be smoke.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:31.590
You lose your head too easily.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:34.670
Be more calm next time.

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:35.590
Here, Nagi-chan!

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:38.590
Hoooot!

00:09:38.590 --> 00:09:40.010
F-Fire!

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:45.390
... is the sort of panicked reaction you shouldn't have.

00:09:45.390 --> 00:09:46.230
Wait, Run!

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:49.110
It's summer! What's with the hot drink?

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:54.280
I was in a rush, so I messed up!

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:58.320
So hot!

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:01.870
So basically, people shouldn't panic.

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:04.790
I couldn't help it!

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:06.910
If it was a real fire, we'd be in trouble.

00:10:07.410 --> 00:10:08.750
Same for me!

00:10:09.250 --> 00:10:11.590
Hot coffee in the summer is unreasonable!

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:12.880
Exactly!

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:15.840
They should take the "hot" off vending machines in the summer!

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:16.550
Yeah.

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:19.760
No, I don't think that's the problem.

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:20.850
Huh?

00:10:28.940 --> 00:10:30.150
Oh no!

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:32.360
What do I do?

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:35.690
I left the survey sheet at school.

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:38.490
That's right!

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:48.870
Yuuko, huh?

00:10:49.460 --> 00:10:52.210
"I left the survey sheet at school.

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:55.340
I want to go get it, but I'm scared to go alone.

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:56.460
Come with me."

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:00.590
Gosh, that's why I said you shouldn't panic...

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:02.390
There we go.

00:11:05.310 --> 00:11:07.680
"Just leave it until next semester"...

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:09.310
I can't do that!

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:16.610
"I want to think it over carefully before filling it in.

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:19.360
I'm begging you, come with me."

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:20.910
Ah, geez.

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:35.040
"I'm too scared," huh?

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:38.880
Oh no!

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:40.300
I'm late!

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:42.220
I'll bet Nagi's there already.

00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:44.050
There she is.

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:45.550
Hey!

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:48.270
Huh?

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:49.600
Why's everyone here?

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:51.770
I called the other two.

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:54.230
Is the front gate not open?

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:56.980
We came in from the back gate.

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:59.030
The back gate's pretty far.

00:11:59.030 --> 00:12:02.740
Yuuko, you'd better sprint here at full speed!

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:03.700
Yeah, yeah!

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:04.820
Here we go!

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:06.120
Ready, start!

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:09.080
You sound impatient.

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:10.040
Listen up!

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:12.080
No matter what, don't look back!

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:13.830
What's that supposed to mean?

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:24.300
Noooo!

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:29.010
That's your personal record.

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:32.020
Well, let's go pick up what you forgot.

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:33.850
Wait.

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.650
I can't move yet.

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:37.020
Ah. She died.

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:44.530
Looks like it's not open.

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:55.210
Is the faculty entrance closed, too?

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.920
I guess this won't cut it.

00:12:58.290 --> 00:12:59.800
What were you trying to open that with?

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:02.920
Curses.

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:11.520
The school really is scary at night.

00:13:31.080 --> 00:13:34.410
Well, you know, sometimes you find a window open.

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:36.960
Pretty careless of them, but it saved us.

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:38.330
That's for sure.

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:40.670
Yuuko, stop clinging to me!

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:41.710
But...

00:13:42.420 --> 00:13:45.260
If I don't hold on to someone, I get nervous.

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:46.430
Fine, fine.

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:50.550
I'll go to the science room and get an anatomical model for you.

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:52.770
No, stop it!

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:54.310
Then get off me!

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:55.520
That's even worse!

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:56.390
Huh?!

00:13:56.690 --> 00:13:59.690
I'm begging you! Don't leave me!

00:13:59.770 --> 00:14:02.610
Gosh, Yuuko, you really are a scaredy-cat.

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:06.860
But the school feels different at night! It's creepy!

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:07.490
Oh.

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:08.280
What?

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:13.620
Hey,

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:16.080
seeing as we're at school at night...

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:19.120
Let's go exploring!

00:14:19.460 --> 00:14:20.210
Huh?!

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:21.420
All right!

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:24.090
And off we go!

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:25.260
All right!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:47.460
Being at school at night really makes your heart race!

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:48.670
Yeah.

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:52.010
I'm scared.

00:15:56.260 --> 00:15:57.310
Um...

00:15:57.810 --> 00:15:58.640
What is it?

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:02.850
Bathroom.

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:06.440
Hey!

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:07.070
Huh?

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:09.570
We're stopping by the bathroom!

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:11.400
'Kay! We'll wait!

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:14.740
I'm not going into the stall with you, though.

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:16.200
I get it, I get it.

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:21.330
Let's see... lights...

00:16:21.870 --> 00:16:22.830
Make it quick.

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.120
Got it.

00:16:28.550 --> 00:16:29.420
What, what?

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:31.590
Well... over there.

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:49.440
Something came out!

00:16:49.440 --> 00:16:51.570
Something came out something came out something came out!

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:53.530
That's not what I meant!

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:02.290
Th-There's a <i>hitodama outside the gym building over there!</i>

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:06.630
<i>Hitodama? That's when someone's soul turns into a spirit right after they die, right?</i>

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:10.710
Well then, if we return it right away, maybe we can save him!

00:17:10.710 --> 00:17:12.010
What are you saying?

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:12.710
Shh!

00:17:16.840 --> 00:17:18.930
This <i>hitodama has feet!</i>

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:19.850
Don't move!

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:21.850
<i>Footsteps...</i>

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:23.810
<i>A burglar?</i>

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:54.460
Huh?

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:55.300
Uni-chan?

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.970
Oh, it was just Satou-sensei.

00:17:59.970 --> 00:18:01.600
How anticlimactic.

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:03.810
What are you doing here so late?

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:07.730
We're here to clean.

00:18:08.230 --> 00:18:09.900
No, we aren't!

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:11.940
I see.

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:14.030
So you're here to get something you forgot.

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:15.440
Yep. That's the story.

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:17.990
Sensei, that candle...

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:20.950
Ah, I'm fond of candles.

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:23.120
This frail, flickering flame

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:25.080
reminds me of my life.

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.330
You could call it empathy.

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:33.840
He collapsed.

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:34.960
Right on cue.

00:18:36.920 --> 00:18:38.430
He's not responding.

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:40.340
What? He seriously blacked out?

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:41.680
Must be a seizure!

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:42.760
Oh no!

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:46.390
First thing's first, we gotta get him to the nurse's office!

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:48.690
You're chafing his face!

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:49.520
Huh?

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:53.820
Damn, he's too heavy.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:55.650
Can I even carry him?

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:56.400
A-hah!

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:57.490
That's right!

00:18:57.490 --> 00:18:59.700
We'll just bring the bed here, instead!

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:01.530
And what's your plan after that?

00:19:02.070 --> 00:19:03.740
Us two will carry this end,

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:04.660
so you take the feet.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:06.500
Tooru, you spot us.

00:19:06.500 --> 00:19:07.250
Got it?

00:19:07.250 --> 00:19:08.290
Yeah.

00:19:08.290 --> 00:19:09.000
Got it.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:10.370
Let's go.

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:12.130
Ready, and...!

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.510
So heavy...

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.420
Up we go...

00:19:21.890 --> 00:19:22.720
<i>Huh?</i>

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:24.050
<i>He got lighter.</i>

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:27.430
Run!

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:29.140
You left the main body behind!

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:30.520
Huh?

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:38.940
Heave-ho!

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:40.950
I'm exhausted.

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:46.990
He's not waking up.

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:48.620
Cut that out.

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:50.620
Sensei, pull yourself together!

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:52.290
If you keep hitting him like that...

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:53.460
<i>Serves him right.</i>

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:56.460
Did he come to?

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:03.260
Sensei!

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:04.970
Please pull yourself together!

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:06.100
Sensei!

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:07.390
Can you hear me?

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:08.560
<i>Run-chan.</i>

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:11.230
Satou-sensei!

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:13.060
I don't want you to die!

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:14.100
<i>Run-chan!</i>

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:17.770
I'm not going to die!

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:19.570
Run-chan...

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:20.400
Grr.

00:20:22.490 --> 00:20:24.070
Run-chan...

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:32.460
Is he all right?

00:20:32.460 --> 00:20:34.540
He did say he wasn't going to die.

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:35.630
Let's go home.

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:37.250
Good idea.

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:43.090
There aren't any more dogs, right?

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:44.630
Of course not!

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:47.260
Ah, man, I'm really exhausted.

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:51.060
Well, good night!

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:52.310
Good night!

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:01.780
Yuuko-chan!

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:04.400
See you later!

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:05.160
Yeah!

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:06.360
See you later!

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:28.300
<i>I'm glad everyone came today.</i>

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:33.020
<i>Oh.</i>

00:21:34.020 --> 00:21:36.440
<i>I forgot it again!</i>

00:23:23.210 --> 00:23:25.170
<i>We ended up making the trip for nothing.</i>

00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:28.130
<i>And I got the scare of my life.</i>

00:23:28.630 --> 00:23:30.260
<i>I can't get to sleep at all.</i>

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:35.430
<i>At my age,</i>

00:23:35.430 --> 00:23:38.310
<i>I can't exactly ask my family to sleep together.</i>

00:23:42.810 --> 00:23:43.940
<i>That's right!</i>

00:23:46.860 --> 00:23:49.320
It's been a while since we slept together, hasn't it?

00:23:51.200 --> 00:23:52.450
Good night.

00:23:57.410 --> 00:24:00.790
Miporin, what do you look forward to at summer festivals?

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:03.210
Well, if I had to say, it's gotta be the fireworks.

00:24:03.210 --> 00:24:04.290
Ahh...

00:24:04.290 --> 00:24:08.250
Also, the octopus balls, savory pancakes, oh, and I love the ginger malt drink.

00:24:08.250 --> 00:24:09.970
Ooh, that sounds nice!

00:24:09.970 --> 00:24:11.510
Yutaka, what do you like?

00:24:11.510 --> 00:24:14.550
Well, all things considered, Yutaka likes to eat a lot-

00:24:16.350 --> 00:24:17.890
Next time on A-Channel!

00:24:17.890 --> 00:24:19.310
"Summer Festival"!

00:24:19.310 --> 00:24:22.310
... to eat a loooot of <i>oden at the night stalls!</i>

00:24:22.310 --> 00:24:23.900
<i>Oden</i>, in the summer?
